Meta.DisplayName=ARK: Survival Ascended (Cluster)
Meta.Description=Cely ARK: Survival Ascended cluster v JEDNE instanci (Windows). Zaskrtnes mapy a Python supervisor je spusti nad jednou instalaci hry se sdilenou konfiguraci a ovladanim z konzole AMP.
